# oracle: fix hmc in 2d (vz untouched by the draws) with resample yes and mom no, two runs (setup resamples each run)
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 2.2e-11, atoms 4.4e-13 (all 50 decisions as native: 31 accepted). The cutoff 2.6 keeps lattice pairs off the cutoff (sq2 0.8 has pairs at exactly r = 2.5).
units           lj
dimension       2
atom_style      atomic
lattice         sq2 0.8
region          box block 0 8 0 8 -0.5 0.5
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 1.0
pair_style      lj/cut 2.6
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0 1.0 2.6
velocity        all create 0.7 87287 loop geom
fix             1 all nve
fix             e all enforce2d
fix             2 all hmc 5 2468 0.7 resample yes mom no
timestep        0.015
thermo_style    custom step temp pe ke etotal f_2 f_2[1] f_2[2] f_2[5]
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          5
run             150
run             100
